arate threshold selection from final evaluation and bind the frozen threshold to a manifest; no magic contamination/percentile cutoff.","Evaluate anomaly utility against a human-review target, cost and capacity using out-of-sample rows. 'Interesting' or visually isolated is not a success metric.","Small clusters/slices require support and uncertainty; do not convert low-n behavior into group-harm conclusions.","Any explanation of a cluster/anomaly must reference the actual features/records responsible and remain associative, not causal.","Preserve S34/S35 abstention routing: invalid/out-of-support cases use the frozen policy destination and count toward workload when routed to humans.","Keep model/card/audit lineage append-only. A cluster/anomaly decision shown in a case file must reference the exact detector version and policy.","Maintain regression tests for S35 NaN/empty support, invalid toy intervals, broken model-card validator, audit-event validation and evidence-layer contamination.","Inherited S26-S35 debt remains active: clustering cannot legitimize contaminated entities/features, leaked evaluation rows, invalid metrics or non-reconstructible decisions."],"status":"READY_TO_CONTINUE_WITH_S36"}